<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Kähler-type embeddings of balls into symplectic manifolds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>The case of complex projective spaces and their products</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Kähler-type embeddings of balls into symplectic manifolds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>The case of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbb{C}}P^{2}\sharp\overline{{\mathbb{C}}P^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ℂ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">♯</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mrow><mi>ℂ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbb{C}}P^{2}\sharp\overline{{\mathbb{C}}P^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In Kähler-type embeddings of balls into symplectic manifolds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>The case of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbb{C}}P^{1}\times{\mathbb{C}}P^{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ℂ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>ℂ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbb{C}}P^{1}\times{\mathbb{C}}P^{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Kähler-type embeddings of balls into symplectic manifolds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Existence of Kähler-type embeddings of balls and Campana-simple complex structures</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S10" title="In Kähler-type embeddings of balls into symplectic manifolds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">10 </span>The case of tori and K3 surfaces</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
